(6898576, 1040201, 27812, '<td valign="top">Outside the box, original and very well taken then processed in your typical excellent standard. I personally would not call it comfort food, but hey, am I here to judge your ''food'' or the photography? 10 from me and with the unfortunate prediction in our crowd you may get more 1s than 10s. Let me know how wrong I am. Love your work, you are in inspiration to the guys who want to learn about creative, fresh thinking!</td>', 'Outside the box, original and very well taken then processed in your typical excellent standard. I personally would not call it comfort food, but hey, am I here to judge your ''food'' or the photography? 10 from me and with the unfortunate prediction in our crowd you may get more 1s than 10s. Let me know how wrong I am. Love your work, you are in inspiration to the guys who want to learn about creative, fresh thinking!', '2012-11-05 09:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
