(6904161, 1040166, 67258, '<td valign="top">Somewhat confused as to why you appear to be pouring washing up liquid over your breakfast! Not quite sure what the breakfast is - toast and bacon?  Looks very different to English breakfasts. From a photographic perspective, I find the uneven lighting a bit distracting, in particular the darker area to the right.</td>', 'Somewhat confused as to why you appear to be pouring washing up liquid over your breakfast! Not quite sure what the breakfast is - toast and bacon?  Looks very different to English breakfasts. From a photographic perspective, I find the uneven lighting a bit distracting, in particular the darker area to the right.', '2012-11-11 15:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6904162, 1040236, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ouch - hope your thumb doesn''t hurt too much!  Pleasing set up and lighting - looks inviting and makes me wish I was eating with you.  I wonder if it might look better still if one of the plates had a portion already dished out?  One minus - in the salad bowl, there is a white globule that clearly doesn''t belong, and doesn''t look appetising.</td>', 'Ouch - hope your thumb doesn''t hurt too much!  Pleasing set up and lighting - looks inviting and makes me wish I was eating with you.  I wonder if it might look better still if one of the plates had a portion already dished out?  One minus - in the salad bowl, there is a white globule that clearly doesn''t belong, and doesn''t look appetising.', '2012-11-11 15:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
